OL,3,GNEWSALocal anger see overnight parking
OL,4,Acharges cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to introduce overnight parking
OL,7,Fcharges at sites run by a local
OL,8,Fauthority have been cancelled, after
OL,9,Fresidents voiced their anger with the
OL,10,Fproposals.
OL,12,FCherwell District Council introduced
OL,13,Fhigher tariffs at its car parks in
OL,14,FBicester and Banbury last month - but
OL,15,Fpaused the proposed introduction of
OL,16,Fovernight fees.
OL,18,FThe authority had planned to introduce
OL,19,Fa #1.60 charge for people to park
OL,20,Fbetween 18:00 and 08:00 BST, which had
OL,21,Fpreviously been free.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
