OL,3,GNEWSALocal anger see overnight parking
OL,4,Acharges cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after there was confusion over
OL,7,Fthe updated charges, after mismatches
OL,8,Fin rates displayed on car park signs
OL,9,Fand machines after the changes were
OL,10,Fspotted.
